		["Ride north-east from {area:442} to {area:445} and fill the {item:15844} at the mouth of the cave by the falls."] = "從{area:442}向東北騎往{area:445}，在瀑布旁的洞口裝滿{item:15844}。",
		["Sickly Gazelles"] = "生病的瞪羚",
