		["{npc:7311} is one of {zone:1454}'s mage trainers. Then take the zeppelin to {zone:1420} from the tower outside {zone:1454}'s main gate."] = "{npc:7311}是{zone:1454}的法師訓練師之一。然後在{zone:1454}正門外的塔搭飛艇前往{zone:1420}。",
