		["Motes of Mannoroth"] = "瑪諾洛斯微粒",
		["Strange Orb atop the {area:444}: right-click the Althalaxx Orb it gives"] = "{area:444}頂端的Strange Orb：右鍵點擊它給的奧薩拉克斯寶珠",
