		["Fill the {item:265732} at the bottom of the waterfalls below {npc:258203}'s cave, where the fresh water meets the brackish."] = "在{npc:258203}的洞穴下方的瀑布底部、淡水與鹹水交會處裝滿{item:265732}。",
		["The blue waterskin"] = "藍色水袋",
