		["Any {skill:185} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:185} (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "你陣營的任何{skill:185}訓練師都能教初級{skill:185}（角色等級5）；箭頭會指向最近的一位。",
